        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXWKaQemLNbturpMgAcfoSchDiQXQdcgzmm5DVOKCQuEdHF2X58=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "I’ve been going to Kulbir for almost 3 years and love every thing she’s done! There are so many options: colour, stickers, foil paper, chrome, sparkle….! She is a pleasure to hang out with and does amazing work! I go every 4 weeks, but my nail art could last longer!",
        "time": 1755086319,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Helena Hum",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108595387887762173922/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLaRljfPJXdckxRRbeoINTajmybQhsvDG0T1ot1XorfeM-z9A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "My daughter and I have been going to Kulbir for the last few months for our manicures and pedicures after finding her on Google with great reviews. Her services are always perfection. I only have wonderful things to say about the services here. Definitely the best place to get your nails done in Vaudreuil-Dorion.",
        "time": 1756151161,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jasleen Purewal",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113954553063989703778/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ21ERWZai8hb_-BkUbLJrJUcNJSqC5hqOiVzZHTfzO4ChruA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Going to this salon is a peaceful and relaxing experience every time! I am constantly asking her to do intricate designs and she nails it every time! Even when it’s a design she’s never done before she’ll never say no and is always willing to try her best at it! Amazing experience!!",
        "time": 1723083575,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
